  <main>
    <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); padding-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Drag &amp; performance artist</span>
        <h1 class="hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 5.4rem); margin-bottom: 0.3em;">
          Miss Texas 1988
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__lead" style="max-width: 60ch;">
          Seattle-based drag artist, performer, host, writer, and all-around creative oddball.
          Producing and hosting shows across Seattle's queer and allied venues — and bringing
          immersive performance art to the city's bigger rooms.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__cta" style="margin-top: 1.4rem;">
          <a class="btn btn--pink" href="assets/files/Miss-Texas-1988-Drag-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download full résumé (PDF) ↓</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="contact.html">Book me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="crown-band crown-band--magenta" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="flipboard"
         aria-label="Selected accolades"
         data-flipboard='["WANNAKIKI S5 WINNER","DRAG S2 WINNER","MX GAY SEATTLE #2","SPOTLIGHT BEST SHOW","SMART VENTURES X2"]'>
      <div class="flipboard__crown" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flipboard__chars" data-flipboard-chars aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flipboard__crown flipboard__crown--right" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>

    <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Awards &amp; honors</span>
        <h2>Trophy shelf.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="awards mt-4">
        <div class="award award--magenta">
          Camp Wannakiki<br/>Season 5
          <small>Winner · OUTtv</small>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          So You Think You Can Drag
          <small>Winner · Season 2</small>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          Mx Gay Seattle #2
          <small>Imperial Sovereign Court</small>
        </div>
        <div class="award award--ink">
          Spotlight Award
          <small>Best Performance &amp; Best Show · Imperial Sovereign Court</small>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          smArt Ventures Grant
          <small>2× recipient · Office of Arts &amp; Culture</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="resume">

        <div class="resume__col">
          <span class="eyebrow">Biography</span>
          <div class="resume__bio mt-2">
            <p>
              Nico Swenson is most known as drag artist <strong>Miss Texas 1988</strong>.
              Performing, producing, and hosting shows at venues such as Unicorn, Clock-Out Lounge,
              Queer Bar, and many other queer and allied bars and venues around the Seattle area.
              In and out of drag they also bring to life immersive performance art experiences —
              most recently <em>"Thank you for Coming"</em> at the Bemis Building, awarded Seattle's
              smArt Ventures grant.
            </p>
            <p>
              They graduated from the University of Minnesota's Theater Arts Department in 2014
              and began a career of solo performance art focused on the intersections of gender,
              capitalism, and the queer art of failure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="resume__heading">Recurring shows</h2>
          <ul class="credit-list">
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">High F@ggotry</div>
                <div>Unicorn</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Monthly · Producer / Host / Cast</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Jawbreaker</div>
                <div>Unicorn</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Monthly · Producer / Host / Cast</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">TUSH</div>
                <div>Clock-Out Lounge</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Monthly · Cast / Fill-In Host</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Sunday Sip</div>
                <div>Red Star Tacoma</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Monthly · Cast</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Glory Hole</div>
                <div>Various locations</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Weekly · Host</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Sparkle Brunch</div>
                <div>Rendezvous</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Weekly · Host</div>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="resume__heading">Past shows of note</h2>
          <ul class="credit-list">
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Grindhaus</div>
                <div>Crocodile</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Featured Performer</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Seattle Reign</div>
                <div>Lumen Field</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Half-time Performance</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Queens of the Cosmos</div>
                <div>Space Needle</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Featured Performer</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Save Her</div>
                <div>Showbox Downtown</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Featured Performer</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">King Princess Tour</div>
                <div>Showbox SoDo</div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Opener</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">NextFest Northwest</div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Curator</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">FukdtUp Variety Show</div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Monthly · Host / Cast</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Critter Barn</div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Critter Person · '18</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Peaches Christ's "Troop Beverly Heels"</div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Trixie Mattel's Daughter</div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div>
                <div class="credit__name">Church of the Auntie Christ</div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="credit__role">Writer / Producer / Performer</div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <aside class="resume__col resume__col--ink">
          <span class="eyebrow" style="background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--yellow);">Education</span>
          <h2 class="resume__heading" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">University of Minnesota</h2>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0.3rem 0 0.2rem;">
            BA Theater Arts · 2010–2014<br/>
            Twin Cities
          </p>

          <h2 class="resume__heading">Reporting</h2>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Reporting for <strong>The Stranger</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="btn btn--blue" style="font-size: 0.75rem;" href="https://www.thestranger.com/author/nico-swenson/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read on The Stranger ↗</a>
          </p>

          <h2 class="resume__heading">Design</h2>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.95rem;">
            And I'm a graphic designer, too — magazine, motion, brand, UI/UX.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="btn btn--blue" style="font-size: 0.75rem;" href="design.html">See the design work →</a>
          </p>

          <h2 class="resume__heading">Get in touch</h2>
          <div class="contact-line">
            <a href="mailto:misstexas1988@gmail.com">Email</a>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/misstexas1988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://tiktok.com/@misstexas1988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok</a>
