    <div class="marquee marquee--yellow" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="marquee__track">
        <span>Now booking 2026</span>
        <span>Hosting · Performing · Producing</span>
        <span>Press &amp; Interviews welcome</span>
        <span>Now booking 2026</span>
        <span>Hosting · Performing · Producing</span>
        <span>Press &amp; Interviews welcome</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section wrap" style="padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);">
      <div class="bigstat reveal">
        <div class="bigstat__number">S5<br/><span style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--magenta);">winner</span></div>
        <div>
          <span class="tag tag--pink">OUTtv · 2024</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2">Camp Wannakiki Season 5</h3>
          <p>The campiest, sweatiest, most unhinged outdoor drag competition — and Miss Texas 1988 took home the title. Watch the full season on OUTtv.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.outtv.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on OUTtv →</a>
        </div>
